OL,3,GNEWSA'I turned heartbreak into starting
OL,4,Aan amazing travel club'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman from Kenilworth who started a
OL,7,Ftravel firm giving solo travellers the
OL,8,Fchance to travel with others says it
OL,9,Fhas now grown to have 15,000 members
OL,10,Facross the UK.
OL,12,FEmma Hickman, 47, started the firm
OL,13,F'Travel Buddies Holidays' 12 years ago
OL,14,Fafter splitting from her boyfriend at
OL,15,Fthe time. She said her daughter had a
OL,16,Fbaby, and she was left feeling
OL,17,F"isolated and lonely".
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,354,350,200,160,0,100
