OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSA'I turned heartbreak into starting
OL,4,Aan amazing travel club'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHickman said she wanted to go out and
OL,7,Fenjoy herself, but friends and family
OL,8,Fwere either not in the same
OL,9,Fcircumstance, could not get time off
OL,10,Fwork, had families or different
OL,11,Ffinancial situations.
OL,13,F"When I split up from my partner, I was
OL,14,Flooking for ideas for social groups and
OL,15,Fthat is what made me create the travel
OL,16,Fclub," she said.
